    "title": "The Chainsmokers performed between Final Four games; is that a good idea?",
    "text": "The Chainsmokers performed between Final Four games; is that a good idea?INDIANAPOLIS -- The NCAA Tournament featured a musical act between the Final Four games at Lucas Oil Stadium and social media was not in favor.The concert was broadcast and is an effort to appeal to more casual fans.Advertisement\"It's an event our clients are asking us for now,\" Dave Aussenberg, a music sponsorship agent at CAA, said of the musical roster with March Madness in Hollywood Reporter. \"When the festival was first conceptualized, it was a nice-to-have complement to a weekend of basketball, but it's growing so much. ... People want entertainment, they want to make a weekend out of an event like this.\"The reviews of playing the college basketball semifinals and national championship received mixed reviews.1 / 11The Chainsmokers perform between Final Four games in IndianapolisThe Chainsmokers perform Saturday, April 4, 2026, between Final Four games at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis.2 / 11See our favorite photos of NCAA Final Four weekend in IndianapolisThe Chainsmokers perform Saturday, April 4, 2026, between Final Four games at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis.11 / 11The Chainsmokers perform between Final Four games in IndianapolisThe Chainsmokers perform Saturday, April 4, 2026, between Final Four games at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis.This article originally appeared on Indianapolis Star: Final Four: Social media, fans react to Chainsmokers, Lucas Oil Stadium",
